(c) **Library source**:
    - JS wrapper source (TS originals) — `wikey-core/vendor/kiwi-nlp/src/`
      (sparse vendor of `bab2min/Kiwi/bindings/wasm/package/src/`).
    - JS wrapper build configuration — `wikey-core/vendor/kiwi-nlp/{package.json,tsconfig.json}`.
    - WASM binary build mechanism (vendor scope outside) — upstream
